                                "sense_id": "9149b557-2f89-3727-a673-8682f06978b8",
                                "text": "Located in a former sign factory and set up as a modern spin on a balconied dinner theater, the Box was conceptualized by a third partner, the downtown fixture Serge Becker, and designed by Cordell Lochin in low-life archaeological style."
                            },
